{"kind":"symbol","topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISONavigationListItem\/init(data:indicatorType:leading:trailing:action:)"],"title":"Initializers","generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISONavigationListItem\/body"],"title":"Instance Properties","generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Properties"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISONavigationListItem\/View-Implementations","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISONavigationListItem\/View-Implementations"],"title":"Default Implementations","generated":true,"anchor":"Default-Implementations"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A list item component used to display a row of interactive, navigable content within a list."}],"metadata":{"platforms":[{"beta":false,"deprecated":false,"name":"iOS","unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"15.0"},{"beta":false,"deprecated":false,"name":"macOS","unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"13.0"},{"beta":false,"deprecated":false,"name":"tvOS","unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"16.0"},{"beta":false,"deprecated":false,"name":"visionOS","unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"1.0"},{"beta":false,"deprecated":false,"name":"watchOS","unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"11.0"}],"title":"MISONavigationListItem","roleHeading":"Structure","externalID":"s:14MISOComponents22MISONavigationListItemV","symbolKind":"struct","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MISONavigationListItem","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MISONavigationListItem","kind":"identifier"}]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISONavigationListItem","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP",